{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The elves are tired of working and have had enough. They're rising up to overthrow Santa, and it's up to you to fight back.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Santa's Last Stand</strong> is a fast-paced roguelike shooter where you'll face endless waves of rebellious elves in a desperate fight for Christmas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your survival skills with intuitive controls:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Move</strong> with WASD</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Shoot</strong> with Left Click</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dash</strong> with Space to escape danger or close the gap</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Select Cards</strong> to power up Santa and gain the edge in battle</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survive as long as you can in this one-life-per-run challenge.</strong> Every decision matters, and only the strongest will save Christmas!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Good luck \u2014 the North Pole is counting on you!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614630?t=1742942651","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3614630?t=1742942651","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614630/1a724a3384dc561fa7bcf61a55a6125ded09ed9d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742942651","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3614630/1a724a3384dc561fa7bcf61a55a6125ded09ed9d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742942651","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The elves are tired of working and have had enough. They're rising up to overthrow Santa, and it's 